# .chktexrc - ChkTeX configuration file
# This file suppresses common "noisy" warnings in LaTeX projects
# to focus on real errors.

# Suppress warnings:
# 1  - Command terminated with space.
# 8  - Wrong length of dash may have been used.
# 12 - Interword spacing (`\.`) should perhaps be used.
# 13 - Intersentence spacing (`\@`) should perhaps be used.
# 15 - No match found for ... (often triggers on custom environments).
# 17 - Number of `(` doesn't match `)` (often false positive in multiline math).
# 24 - Delete this space to maintain correct pagereferences.
# 36 - Put references before punctuation.
CmdLine
{
    -n1 -n8 -n12 -n13 -n15 -n17 -n24 -n36
}
